# Data + artefacts – never committed. Datasets live on HF Hub, models on the CDN.
data/pool/

# `data/legacy/` is 138 MB of imported imagery and is not committed - with ONE
# exception, which is not derived data. `adjudication.json` is the record of 403
# human form-factor decisions: who decided what, and when. Nothing can
# regenerate it. The legacy labels are waste STREAMS and a stream does not
# determine a shape - measured, the stream-derived mapping is wrong on 28.8 % of
# these very crops. Losing it means a person looking at 403 pictures again.
#
# Git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded, so the
# directories are walked open and their contents excluded instead. Do not
# collapse this back to `data/legacy/`.
data/legacy/*
!data/legacy/pool/
data/legacy/pool/*
!data/legacy/pool/adjudication.json
artifacts/
runs/
*.pt
*.onnx
*.zip
!data/taxonomy/**

